        "finite_difference_fields_reconstruct_their_source_without_extra_modes",
        "cyclic_zero_field_backgrounds_have_exactly_two_native_kernel_roles"
      ],
      "scope_boundary": "Constitutive mismatch evolves by the inverse native continuation and feeds a calculable signed source. Source potential recovery needs the constitutive and boundary constraints. No electromagnetic Gauss law or stochastic noise is imported."
    },
    {
      "id": "R29.4",
      "title": "The paired update has an exact positive conserved field form",
      "written_section_sha256": "5dfaee5612b3bdb621b1732b066e35a156bee093a023f5f58c9a7e3226d9c1c9",
